  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven: 21 × 8 – 18 + (64 ÷ 2) + 32 = 64 \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1) 32 and 64\n\n21 × 8 – 18 + (64 ÷ 2) + 32 = 64 ⇒ 21 × 8 – 18 + (32 ÷ 2) + 64 = 64\n\n⇒ 21 × 8 – 18 + __**(32 ÷ 2)**__ + 64 = 64\n\n⇒ __**21 × 8**__ – 18 + 16 + 64 = 64\n\n⇒ __168 + 16 + 64__ – 18 = 64\n\n⇒ __248** – 18**__ = 64\n\n⇒ 230 ≠ 64 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 8 and 18\n\n21 × 8 – 18 + (64 ÷ 2) + 32 = 64 ⇒ 21 × 18 – 8 + (64 ÷ 2) + 32 = 64\n\n⇒ 21 × 18 – 8 + __**(64 ÷ 2)**__ + 32 = 64\n\n⇒ __**21 × 18**__ – 8 + 32 + 32 = 64\n\n⇒ __**378 + 32 + 32**__ – 8 = 64\n\n⇒ __442** – 8**__ = 64\n\n⇒ 434 ≠ 64 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 18 and 32\n\n21 × 8 – 18 + (64 ÷ 2) + 32 = 64 ⇒ 21 × 8 – 32 + (64 ÷ 2) + 18 = 64\n\n⇒ 21 × 8 – 32 + __**(64 ÷ 2)**__ + 18 = 64\n\n⇒ __**21 × 8**__ – 32 + 32 + 18 = 64\n\n⇒ __**168 + 32 + 18**__ – 32 = 64\n\n⇒ __218____** **____**– 32**__ = 64\n\n⇒ 186 ≠ 64 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 8 and 2\n\n21 × 8 – 18 + (64 ÷ 2) + 32 = 64 ⇒ 21 × 2 – 18 + (64 ÷ 8) + 32 = 64\n\n⇒ 21 × 2 – 18 + __**(64 ÷ 8)**__ + 32 = 64\n\n⇒ __**21 × 2**__ – 18 + 8 + 32 = 64\n\n⇒ __**42 + 8 + 32**__ – 18 = 64\n\n⇒ __82____** – 18**__ = 64\n\n**⇒ 64 = 64 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
